# Optional applications (group: app).
#
# Members are drawn from the git, third-party and stable recipe categories —
# membership here does not remove a package from its category group, and a
# package must be listed in at least one group file.
#
# Semantics (see 'build-all.fish -h'):
#   - On a TTY, a build or -n run prompts to multi-select from this list;
#     confirming with everything unchecked builds every entry below, checking
#     any entry builds only the checked ones.
#   - Non-TTY runs and -l use the whole list without prompting.
#   - App packages are leaf builds: their dependency chain is never expanded
#     (they are ABI consumers, so installed dependencies are assumed current).
#
# One package ID per line; '#' starts a comment. Membership is wired
# separately — this file intentionally starts empty.
